  "notes": [
    "PriceOracleProxy is a plain non-delegating deployment. Its runtime is byte-identical at the deployment block and at block 13499797, and the prestateTracer code for the anchor transaction hashes to the same value, so the deployment is the last executable-code change. Later _setYVaultTokens and _setAggregators calls changed configuration mappings only and are context, not code.",
    "Exact victim depletion measured from receipts: for every market in the Cream Comptroller's getAllMarkets() at block 13499797, the net movement of that market's own underlying() token across the nine successful campaign transactions, plus native-ETH flows for crETH. Fifty-seven ERC-20 markets and crETH are net negative and every recipient is one of the two attacker contracts. Attacker-supplied flash-loan principal is excluded because it is netted inside the same measurement; the recursive crYUSD leg therefore contributes only 1,424.188372514512394279 yUSD. Fifty-two components use DefiLlama historical prices for the anchor timestamp; six underlyings with no DefiLlama series (yvCurve-stETH, HBTC, vVSP, yvCurve-IronBank, ibBTC, yUSD) use Cream's own unmanipulated getUnderlyingPrice at block 13499797 converted at the same DefiLlama ETH price and are marked method other. The 144.4 million total exceeds the ~130 million commonly reported; the gap is concentrated in thin-market components (CRETH2 at 39.9 million, RUNE, wNXM, PERP) which are marked at contemporaneous quotes and which the attacker could not have liquidated at those quotes, so realised attacker proceeds were lower than this gross victim depletion.",
    "Six of the 58 loss components have no DefiLlama price series and are valued from Cream's own pre-manipulation getUnderlyingPrice at block 13499797 converted at the DefiLlama ETH price, a protocol-internal basis.",
    "Thin-market components, chiefly 12,266.46 CRETH2, are marked at contemporaneous quotes; gross victim depletion therefore exceeds what the attacker could have realised by selling.",
    "The seed inventory aged this row from the crYUSD market 0x4baa77013ccd6705ab0522853cb0e9d453579dd4. That market applied the price it was given correctly; the defect-bearing artifact is the PriceOracleProxy that produced the price, so the target and the code age were moved to it. The crYUSD market and the Comptroller remain part of the causal path but are not separately aged.",
    "Distinct from the August 2021 crAMP reentrancy recorded as eip155:1:0xa9a1b8ea288eb9ad315088f17f7c7386b9989c95b4d13c81b69d5ddad7ffe61e."
  ]
